{"change_summary":"Updated the budget-helper contract and tests so carbon conservation is only asserted on actually closed fixtures, O2 gets a dedicated open-system balance assertion, and the env-driven debug path is exercised. In practice this added gross-flow accounting to `BudgetInspector`, rewrote `assert_o2_balanced` to reconcile recorded O2 in/out against observed inventory changes, clarified the docs for `assert_c_conserved`/`assert_budget_balanced`, and tightened the helper/budget-tracking fixtures by zeroing gas-transfer terms via KLA plus filter flow while keeping the filter logically enabled for nitrification scenarios.","outstanding_risks":["A broader regression run still fails outside the helper remediation scope: `cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking -- --nocapture` reports `test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c` (no deterministic hatching) and `test_high_mortality_200_hours_conserves_n_c_and_accumulates_detritus` (carbon drift at hour 25).","The worktree already contains unrelated local modifications outside the helper files, so a full green suite for the repository was not established in this stage."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the current budget-helper implementation, carbon/O2 test failures, and the fixture/setup assumptions behind the remediation notes.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Implement the helper/test fixes: clarify the carbon closed-system contract, add real O2 balance accounting, close the retrofit fixtures against gas exchange, and add env-enabled debug-path coverage.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Run targeted validation for the helper suite and the closed-system budget-tracking checks, then record the remaining unrelated failures from a broader regression run.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_helpers -- --nocapture` passed (12 passed, 0 failed), including the retrofit helper test, direct `assert_o2_balanced` coverage, and the `TANK_BUDGET_DEBUG=1` path.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking test_closed_system_c_conservation -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking test_closed_system_n_conservation -- --nocapture` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking -- --nocapture` still fails, but the remaining failures are in `test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c` and `test_high_mortality_200_hours_conserves_n_c_and_accumulates_detritus`, not in the helper/carbon remediation paths."]}